{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2022-01-07 09:30:00', 'title': 'AT&T OFFERS ELIGIBLE CUSTOMERS LOW-COST BROADBAND THROUGH NEW FEDERAL PROGRAM', 'text': "DALLAS, JAN. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHAT'S THE NEWS ?\xa0\xa0AT&T* AND CRICKET WIRELESS OPENED ENROLLMENT TODAY FOR THE NEW FEDERAL AFFORDABLE CONNECTIVITY PROGRAM (ACP), WHICH LOWERS THE MONTHLY COST OF BROADBAND SERVICE FOR ELIGIBLE CUSTOMERS AND WILL HELP CLOSE THE DIGITAL DIVIDE."}